Basalt
======

What is this?
-------------

Basalt is a LSM-tree based key-value store. It supports
lookups, inserts, deletes, and range scans over integer
keys and values.


Requirements
------------

* g++
* libgtest


Commands
--------

make          Build Basalt
make cli      Run Basalt
make test     Test Basalt
make clean    Remove Basalt


Session
-------

put <key> <val>       Insert/update a key-value pair
get <key>             Retrieve the value associated with a key
del <key>             Delete a key-value pair
scan <start> <end>    Retrieve all pairs whose keys fall within [start, end]
help                  Print help message
exit                  Exit the session


Project Layout
--------------

libs/         Libraries
src/buf/      Extendible buffer pool
src/database/ LSM-tree engine
src/disk/     SSTable writer
src/filter/   Bloom filter
src/storage/  B+ tree builder
src/memtable/ AVL-tree memtable
tests/        Unit tests
